# QCode-Method framework repo — keep it lean.
# (This is the framework itself; it does not run an app, so there are few build artifacts.)

# qcode-sync writes these into TARGET projects, never here — ignored as a safety net:
*.qcode-bak

# 05.4 installed the real cockpit/board-check tooling into this repo (it dogfoods its own method
# now) — the rendered cockpit is a point-in-time build artifact, regenerated on demand via
# `node cockpit/generate.mjs`, same as the template's own .gitignore already excludes it:
cockpit/index.html

# Node, if ever introduced:
node_modules/

# OS / editor noise:
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.claude/settings.local.json
